  "body_html": "<p>I connecting to Oracle Cloud Infrastructure consoles asks you for MFA authentication each time you connect, here is how to have a grace period of 15 days. I've followed the instructions from Freek D'Hooge (this should deserve tons of ACE points in my opinion 😉)</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/dhoogfr/status/1727745140242944163?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://x.com/dhoogfr/status/1727745140242944163?s=20</a></p>\n\n<p><iframe class=\"tweet-embed\" scrolling=\"no\" id=\"tweet-1727746661806457163-93\" src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/embed/Tweet.html?id=1727746661806457163\">\n</iframe>\n<script>\n  // Detect dark theme\n  var iframe = document.getElementById('tweet-1727746661806457163-93');\n  if (document.body.className.includes('dark-theme')) {\n    iframe.src = \"https://platform.twitter.com/embed/Tweet.html?id=1727746661806457163&theme=dark\"\n  }\n\n</script>\n\n</p>\n\n<p>Let's go, with screenshots:</p>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"identity-amp-security-gt\" href=\"#identity-amp-security-gt\">\n  </a>\n  \"Identity &amp; Security\" --&gt;\n</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ffsxpy1vt2u3hxltrm66m.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ffsxpy1vt2u3hxltrm66m.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"646\"></a></p>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"domains-gt-default\" href=\"#domains-gt-default\">\n  </a>\n  \"Domains\" --&gt; \"Default\"\n</h2>\n\n<p>(or other domain in case you have multiple have been converted from IDCS)</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fgah31yi2voja06lg2skn.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fgah31yi2voja06lg2skn.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"742\"></a></p>\n\n<p>##  -&gt; \"Security\" </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fcn4trp4csmsk5jcjctnc.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fcn4trp4csmsk5jcjctnc.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"675\"></a></p>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"gt-signon-policies\" href=\"#gt-signon-policies\">\n  </a>\n  --&gt; \"Sign-on Policies\"\n</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fja28pkksy7any6gk8bkp.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fja28pkksy7any6gk8bkp.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"625\"></a></p>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"gt-select-a-policy\" href=\"#gt-select-a-policy\">\n  </a>\n  --&gt; select a policy\n</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fk9ap5r8svujucd2zrz8b.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fk9ap5r8svujucd2zrz8b.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"581\"></a></p>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"gt-click-on-the-more-menu-next-to-the-rule\" href=\"#gt-click-on-the-more-menu-next-to-the-rule\">\n  </a>\n  --&gt; click on the more  menu next to the rule\n</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F9bm3cs7mko1e5jd8vutm.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F9bm3cs7mko1e5jd8vutm.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"430\"></a></p>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"gt-set-the-interval-in-the-actions\" href=\"#gt-set-the-interval-in-the-actions\">\n  </a>\n  --&gt; set the interval in the actions\n</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fsiksyeedgo052471f61g.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fsiksyeedgo052471f61g.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"689\"></a></p>\n\n<p>Do this for every policy and rule<br>\nYou will have 2 policies by default (1 standard, 1 added by Oracle when they made MFA mandatory</p>\n\n<p>That policy will have 2 rules, 1 for all users and 1 for admins</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fv40pspulqky7rccdlun3.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fv40pspulqky7rccdlun3.png\" alt=\" \" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"799\" height=\"355\"></a></p>\n\n",
  "body_markdown": "I connecting to Oracle Cloud Infrastructure consoles asks you for MFA authentication each time you connect, here is how to have a grace period of 15 days. I've followed the instructions from Freek D'Hooge (this should deserve tons of ACE points in my opinion 😉)\n\nhttps://x.com/dhoogfr/status/1727745140242944163?s=20\n\n{% embed https://x.com/dhoogfr/status/1727746661806457163?s=20 %}\n\nLet's go, with screenshots:\n\n## \"Identity & Security\" -->\n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/fsxpy1vt2u3hxltrm66m.png)\n\n## \"Domains\" --> \"Default\"\n\n(or other domain in case you have multiple have been converted from IDCS)\n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/gah31yi2voja06lg2skn.png)\n\n ##  -> \"Security\" \n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/cn4trp4csmsk5jcjctnc.png)\n\n## --> \"Sign-on Policies\" \n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/ja28pkksy7any6gk8bkp.png)\n\n## --> select a policy \n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/k9ap5r8svujucd2zrz8b.png)\n\n## --> click on the more  menu next to the rule \n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/9bm3cs7mko1e5jd8vutm.png)\n\n\n## --> set the interval in the actions\n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/siksyeedgo052471f61g.png)\n\nDo this for every policy and rule\nYou will have 2 policies by default (1 standard, 1 added by Oracle when they made MFA mandatory\n\nThat policy will have 2 rules, 1 for all users and 1 for admins\n\n![Image description](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/v40pspulqky7rccdlun3.png)\n\n",
